@startuml
title First-party Campus Attendance Sequence

actor User
boundary Browser
control AttendanceApi
control AttendanceService
database Database
collections PrivateObjectStorage

== Clock in ==
User -> Browser: Select "Clock in"
Browser -> Browser: Request camera and location permission
Browser -> AttendanceApi: Submit selfie and location proof
AttendanceApi -> AttendanceService: Validate authenticated user
AttendanceService -> Database: Load assigned campus geofence
AttendanceService -> AttendanceService: Validate location inside geofence
AttendanceService -> PrivateObjectStorage: Store private selfie object
AttendanceService -> Database: Record server clock-in and capture metadata
AttendanceApi --> Browser: Active session confirmation
Browser --> User: Show clock-in time and campus

== Clock out ==
User -> Browser: Select "Clock out"
Browser -> Browser: Capture selfie and current location
Browser -> AttendanceApi: Submit clock-out proof
AttendanceApi -> AttendanceService: Validate active session
AttendanceService -> Database: Load active session and campus geofence
AttendanceService -> AttendanceService: Validate location and timestamp ordering
AttendanceService -> PrivateObjectStorage: Store private selfie object
AttendanceService -> Database: Record server clock-out and duration
AttendanceService -> Database: Append audit event
AttendanceApi --> Browser: Completed session and duration
Browser --> User: Show worked duration

note over AttendanceService
No facial recognition is performed.
Server timestamps are authoritative.
Failed attempts must not expose selfie data.
end note
@enduml
